# Raw secret value, one line, no KEY= prefix — Authelia reads this file
# via AUTHELIA_AUTHENTICATION_BACKEND_LDAP_PASSWORD_FILE
# (services.authelia.instances.main.environmentVariables).
# Must match the password set for the dedicated
# uid=authelia,ou=people,<base dn> bind account created in LLDAP's own
# admin UI — see modules/authelia.nix and docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
REPLACE-ME-TO-MATCH-THE-LLDAP-AUTHELIA-BIND-ACCOUNT-PASSWORD
